.TH PTOUCH-STUDIO 1 "2026-07-27" "P-touch Studio 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ptouch-studio \- design and print labels for Brother P-touch tape cassettes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ptouch-studio
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Prints labels on Brother P-touch label printers over Bluetooth. The width of the
inserted tape cassette is read from the printer itself, so a label is always laid
out for the tape that is actually loaded.
.PP
Started without a command, the graphical interface opens.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B print \fItext\fR...
Print a label. Each argument becomes one line.
.TP
.B status
Report the loaded tape, the media type and the readiness of the printer.
Add \fB\-\-json\fR for machine-readable output.
.TP
.B scan
Look for P-touch devices in range.
.TP
.B setup
Find, pair and configure the printer.
.TP
.B check
Check the setup and list what is missing.
.SH PRINT OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-w ", " \-\-width " " \fImm\fR
Tape width. Without it, the printer is asked.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-size " " \fIpt\fR
Font size. Without it, the size fills the printable tape height.
.TP
.BR \-l ", " \-\-length " " \fImm\fR
Fixed label length instead of one that follows the text.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-align " " \fIleft|center|right\fR
Horizontal alignment.
.TP
.BR \-m ", " \-\-margin " " \fImm\fR
Side margin, 3 mm by default.
.TP
.BR \-n ", " \-\-copies " " \fIcount\fR
Number of copies.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-font " " \fIname\fR
Font family.
.TP
.B \-\-frame
Draw a frame around the label.
.TP
.B \-\-mirror
Mirror the label, for transparent tape read from behind.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-cut
Do not cut automatically.
.TP
.BI \-\-pdf " file"
Write a PDF instead of printing.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/ptouch-studio/P-touch Studio/config.json
Printer, queue and RFCOMM port of this user.
.TP
.I /etc/ptouch-studio/rfcomm.conf
Bluetooth address and port index, written by the setup.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Zero on success. Non-zero when the printer is unreachable, the setup is
incomplete or the job could not be delivered.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lp (1),
.BR lpstat (1),
.BR rfcomm (1)
.PP
https://github.com/tombueng/ptouch-studio
